    "line": 41,
    "proposition": "ForwardRamanujan.Updated.data.length = 7 ∧\n  ForwardRamanujan.Updated.targets.length = 7 ∧\n    (∀ j ∈ Finset.range 7,\n        [262, 394 / 3915, 28 / 528525, 716 / 20002028625, 2096 / 78307942066875, 17161 / 919726779575446875, 0][j]! /\n            4096 ≤\n          ForwardRamanujan.Updated.data[j]!) ∧\n      (∀ j ∈ Finset.range 7,\n          if\n              [262, 394 / 3915, 28 / 528525, 716 / 20002028625, 2096 / 78307942066875, 17161 / 919726779575446875,\n                      0][j]! /\n                  4096 <\n                1 / 2 ^ 40 then\n            ForwardRamanujan.Updated.data[j]! = 1 / 2 ^ 40\n          else True) ∧\n        ForwardRamanujan.Updated.targets.sum ≤ ForwardRamanujan.Updated.scale * ForwardRamanujan.Updated.data.sum"
   },
   {
